w.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T07:00:53-07:00","id":1440196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1439984-v-tm-netflix-amazon-series?p=1440191#post1440191\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I just call it TZIMISCE: THE SERIES.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nador the Relentless is my go to for Old clan.<br /> <br /> I am pretty sure Lazlo and Nadja are Toreador anti","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T11:54:45-07:00","id":1440226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1439984-v-tm-netflix-amazon-series?p=1440188#post1440188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the biggest mistake that Kindred: the Embraced made was that it wasn't Sasha's story.<br /> <br /> Start with the Neonate and unveil the rest.</div> </div> </div> </div>Normally I would agree that a newcomer POV character is best for educating the non-gamers into the lore, except there is one major pitfall to that. Specifically that if the series spends too much time at the POV characters level it gets boring and the audience loses interest. On the other hand if the writers can't think of an engaging story for the neonate, they will rush the storyline to get to the elders who are interesting. Hence why all the vampire stories that suddenly involve the council of elders, the progenitor of all vampires, or what ever other high level nonsense they think can be dropped in like a villain of the week.<br /> <br /> That high end stuff should be like the white walkers in GoT or the Yellow King in True Detective season 1, always part of the story but only in the shadows. To use an older series as an example anything elder vampire level should be reveled like the truth behind the Shadows and Vorlons in Babylon 5, with four seasons worth of world building. But I doubt most writers are up to the task of such a thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T12:53:38-07:00","id":1440236,"title":"","content":"I really think the first thing to do with the WoD is to actively try and capitalize on audience ignorance. Build up mystery. <br /> <br /> <br /> A happily married man is utterly infatuated with another and he slowly slides into doing the bidding of this mysterious person at the expense of his personal life. He is confused and distraught concerning his lack of control, the fear of being caught by either the law of his wife, and it all just seems to get worse. He also notes that this person seems very adverse to eating, and usually can't find him during the day. <br /> -A man gets shot too many times and, while seemingly dead and people distracted, his body, out of focus, gets up and leaves. <br /> -An old woman recognizes a young man, and is terrified, she claims he was involved in an event more than twenty years ago, something he's seemingly far too young to have been involved with, and she causes a commotion. The next day she has no recollection of the events, though her health seems to be perfectly normal. <br /> -A woman finds out that several important people she has dealings with don't seem to exist. <br /> -An agent shows up at someone's house inquiring about a traumatic event that was witnessed. The agent retells the story that's very obviously incorrect to the audience, but the subject completely internalizes this new retelling. The agent will show up again to do the same to another family.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T13:24:36-07:00","id":1440250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1439984-v-tm-netflix-amazon-series?p=1440236#post1440236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really think the first thing to do with the WoD is to actively try and capitalize on audience ignorance. Build up mystery.<br /> <br /> <br /> A happily married man is utterly infatuated with another and he slowly slides into doing the bidding of this mysterious person at the expense of his personal life. He is confused and distraught concerning his lack of control, the fear of being caught by either the law of his wife, and it all just seems to get worse. He also notes that this person seems very adverse to eating, and usually can't find him during the day.<br /> -A man gets shot too many times and, while seemingly dead and people distracted, his body, out of focus, gets up and leaves.<br /> -An old woman recognizes a young man, and is terrified, she claims he was involved in an event more than twenty years ago, something he's seemingly far too young to have been involved with, and she causes a commotion. The next day she has no recollection of the events, though her health seems to be perfectly normal.<br /> -A woman finds out that several important people she has dealings with don't seem to exist.<br /> -An agent shows up at someone's house inquiring about a traumatic event that was witnessed. The agent retells the story that's very obviously incorrect to the audience, but the subject completely internalizes this new retelling. The agent will show up again to do the same to another family.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that a V:TM protagonist should be a young hot twenty something Goth.<br /> <br /> Probably with issues against authority.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> What?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> AND WE CAN PUT IT ON THE CW!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T14:14:47-07:00","id":1440261,"title":"","content":"Nah, a devileshly handsome 40 year old noir-detective with an unhealthy fixation on pen and paper rpgs. <br /> But really, you want to build a small group/coterie /pack. Mostly so they have people to bouce off of. In a world where everyone's lying you need, for the audience at least, someone for expository speculation and truth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T17:15:41-07:00","id":1440298,"title":"","content":"The scooby gang would need to be in the same faction, most likely on Path of Humanity, and not of any clans or bloodlines that sets up shop in NSFW territory by default. Further more since you want the young adult market, you can't have any of them be older than early college age and since they are that young, they can't be specialists, which means they were embraced for reasons other than competency. A sabbat mass embrace that defected to the Camarilla, a group of toreador or brujah have a flight of fancy, etc.<br /> <br /> Once you have selected the basics, then you would have to consider the budget required for each clan. The Gangrel, Nosferatu, and Tzimisce are going to require lots of prosthetic make up as well as animal wranglers. The Ventrue and Toreador need designer labels as well as expensive tastes such as luxury vehicles and havens. Alternatively something like the Lasombra could easily break the bank with CG costs with Obtenebration use. Any group that uses necromancy or thaumaturgy will require tons of props, practical effects and CG augmentation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T17:19:07-07:00","id":1440299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1439984-v-tm-netflix-amazon-series?p=1440298#post1440298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The scooby gang would need to be in the same faction, most likely on Path of Humanity, and not of any clans or bloodlines that sets up shop in NSFW territory by default. Further more since you want the young adult market, you can't have any of them be older than early college age and since they are that young, they can't be specialists, which means they were embraced for reasons other than competency. A sabbat mass embrace that defected to the Camarilla, a group of toreador or brujah have a flight of fancy, etc.<br /> <br /> Once you have selected the basics, then you would have to consider the budget required for each clan. The Gangrel, Nosferatu, and Tzimisce are going to require lots of prosthetic make up as well as animal wranglers. The Ventrue and Toreador need designer labels as well as expensive tastes such as luxury vehicles and havens. Alternatively something like the Lasombra could easily break the bank with CG costs with Obtenebration use. Any group that uses necromancy or thaumaturgy will require tons of props, practical effects and CG augmentation.</div> </div> </div> </div>I shit you not, reading all the impediments, like Nosferatu ugliness and Tzimisce, it seems like 5th Edition exists entirely to make it easier to adapt to television.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga