 romp. An exaggerated truth rather than pure fantasy, if you will. </span></span></span><br /> While in general historical accuracy has improved over the years with people enthused by insightful youtube historians, it's not good enough. Vikings is, for some reason, remains very popular, and DAV20 was very liberal with it's history (disrespectful I'd say, but nobody wants to stand up for small european nations filled with white people, lest they be confused with something/the book had a small audience)<br /> <br /> In other words, don't touch the dark ages (outside maybe small flashbacks for a modern series)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T13:59:17-07:00","id":1441696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AscentionTheMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1439984-v-tm-netflix-amazon-series?p=1441691#post1441691\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Devilman crybaby is one of the best things netflix produced, including House of Cards and Sense8.</div> </div> </div> </div>I absolutely couldn't bear to watch past the first episode. <br /> <br /> <br /> Castlevenia was decent enough. Helped that we had just played one of the games before it ai